  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for Green Climate Fund Project: &quot;Pathways to Dairy Net Zero: Promoting Low Carbon Emission and Resilient Livestock in East Africa&quot;. Support for Proposal Preparation, East Africa (ref: 720RFS23IO00004)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project is a technical assistance (TA) intervention to support the design of the GCF and IFAD-funded Dairy Interventions for Adaptation and Mitigation (DaIMA, former Pathways to Dairy Net Zero - PADNET), which aims to reduce greenhouse gas (GHG) emissions and increase climate resilience in the dairy sector, in countries that will be defined in a later stage)</narrative>
  </description>
